Trafficmancy was a little thing I put together so that I could say I contributed something to all of this.  
I'm not an artist (yet...?) and I never even heard people talk about 'practice'` before starting this role.

Tech-wise, the responses you're getting are coming from the Ollama dolphin-phi model that is running entirely on the little machine on the left,  
and the camera is being used to count how many people/cars/etc move past in a ten-second period.  
The interface was made with a Python library called pyxel that weirdly doesn't seem to accept the existence of the pound symbol?

